// The manifest, embedded in the executable. `1` is
// CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID and `24` is RT_MANIFEST; both are
// written out rather than included from <winuser.h>, because that is the only
// thing this file would need the header for.
1 24 "greeting.manifest"
